Chr4	Araport11	gene	756348	758725	.	+	.	ID=AT4G01750;Name=AT4G01750;Note=rhamnogalacturonan xylosyltransferase 2;curator_summary=Encodes a protein with UDP-xylose-dependent xylosyltransferase activity, which transfers Xyl onto L-fucose and (albeit less efficiently) L-arabinose. The linkage to L-fucose was shown to be preferentially to the <i>O</i>-4 position. Analysis of mutant containing T-DNA insertion in this gene indicate that the RGXT2 protein might be involved in the synthesis of the &alpha-D-Xyl-(1,3)-&alpha-L-Fuc-(1,4)-L-Rha structure in pectic rhamnogalacturonan II. The mRNA is cell-to-cell mobile.;computational_description=rhamnogalacturonan xylosyltransferase 2;locus=2133457;locus_type=protein_coding
