Chr4	Araport11	gene	7349187	7353135	.	-	.	ID=AT4G12420;Name=AT4G12420;Note=Cupredoxin superfamily protein;curator_summary=Encodes a protein of unknown function involved in directed root tip growth. It is a member of 19-member gene family and is distantly related structurally to the multiple-copper oxidases ascorbate oxidase and laccase, though it lacks the copper-binding domains. The protein is glycosylated and GPI-anchored. It is localized to the plasma membrane and the cell wall. The gene is expressed most strongly in expanding tissues.;computational_description=Cupredoxin superfamily protein;locus=2135535;locus_type=protein_coding
