Chr4	Araport11	gene	7878652	7878760	.	-	.	ID=AT4G13555;Name=AT4G13555;curator_summary=Encodes a microRNA, expressed in shoot vasculature and apical meristem, that targets several Laccase family members. Over expression of mir397B causes increased shoot and seed size and lignification this phenotype is correlated with decreased expression of Lac4.  MicroRNAs are regulatory RNAs with a mature length of ~21-nucleotides that are processed from hairpin precursors by Dicer-like enzymes. MicroRNAs can negatively regulate gene expression by attenuating translation or by directing mRNA cleavage.Mature sequence: UCAUUGAGUGCAUCGUUGAUG;locus=4010713886,4010713886;locus_type=mirna
