Chr4	Araport11	gene	9990988	9994524	.	-	.	ID=AT4G18010;Name=AT4G18010;Note=myo-inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase 2;curator_summary=Encodes an inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase that appears to have Type I activity. It can dephosphorylate IP3(inositol(1,4,5)P3) and IP4 (inositol(1,3,4,5)P4), but it does not appear to be active against phosphatidylinositol 4,5 bisphosphate. Overexpression of this gene renders plants insensitive to ABA in germination and growth assays.;computational_description=myo-inositol polyphosphate 5-phosphatase 2;locus=2141095;locus_type=protein_coding
