Chr4	Araport11	gene	10201672	10203469	.	-	.	ID=AT4G18480;Name=AT4G18480;Note=P-loop containing nucleoside triphosphate hydrolases superfamily protein;curator_summary=Encodes the CHLI subunit of magnesium chelatase which is required for chlorophyll biosynthesis. All four cysteine residues of the protein form two disulfide bonds (Cys102-Cys193 and Cys354-Cys396) under oxidized conditions but are fully reduced by reduction. It was suggested that the redox state of CHLI is regulated in vivo by the change of the redox environment in the chloroplasts probably via the Trx system.;computational_description=P-loop containing nucleoside triphosphate hydrolases superfamily protein;locus=2005500;locus_type=protein_coding
