###
Chr4	Araport11	gene	11008558	11013860	.	+	.	ID=AT4G20400;Name=AT4G20400;Note=JUMONJI 14;curator_summary=Encodes a histone H3K4 demethylase repressing floral transition.Coordinates and structure features have been deposited in the RCSB Protein Data Bank with the accession codes 5YKN (JMJ14CD) and 5YKO(JMJ14CD-NOG-H3K4em3 complex). Glu285 and Glu516 contribute to the recognition of H3R2. Asp312 contributes to the recognition of H3Q5. Phe171 and Val363 contribute to the recognition of H3A7. Ser290, Trp296, and Tyr298 contribute to the recognition of H3K4me3 (PMID:29233856).
