Chr4	Araport11	gene	12299749	12302935	.	+	.	ID=AT4G23570;Name=AT4G23570;Note=phosphatase-related;curator_summary=Closely related to SGT1B, may function in SCF(TIR1) mediated protein degradation. AtSGT1a and AtSGT1b are functionally redundant in the resistance to pathogenes. AtSGT1b was more highly  expressed than AtSGT1. The N-terminal TPR domain of  AtSGT1a reduces the steady-state level of Arabidopsis SGT1  proteins whereas the same domain from AtSGT1b enhances  SGT1 accumulation. The TPR domain is dispensable for SGT1 resistance. AtSGT1a is induced upon pathogen infection and can function in R gene-mediated resistance.;computational_description=phosphatase-like protein;locus=2128404;locus_type=protein_coding
