Chr4	Araport11	gene	12962965	12966629	.	-	.	ID=AT4G25350;Name=AT4G25350;Note=EXS (ERD1/XPR1/SYG1) family protein;curator_summary=SHB1 encodes a nuclear and cytosolic protein that has motifs  homologous with SYG1 protein family members. Acts in cryptochrome signaling. Overexpression of SHB1 enhanced the expression of PHYTOCHROME-INTERACTING  FACTOR4 (PIF4) under red light and promoted proteasome-mediated degradation of phytochrome A and hypocotyl elongation under far-red light. A knockout allele suppressed LONG HYPOCOTYL IN FAR-RED LIGHT1 (HFR1) expression and showed several deetiolation  phenotypes. Acts upstream of HFR1. Regulates seed development.;computational_description=EXS (ERD1/XPR1/SYG1) family protein;locus=2138038;locus_type=protein_coding
