Chr4	Araport11	gene	13024498	13027484	.	+	.	ID=AT4G25500;Name=AT4G25500;Note=arginine/serine-rich splicing factor 35;curator_summary=Encodes an arginine/serine-rich splicing factor. The transcript is alternatively spliced and is differentially expressed in different tissues (flowers, roots, stems, and leaves) examined. Barta et al (2010) have proposed a nomenclature for Serine/Arginine-Rich Protein Splicing Factors (SR proteins): Plant Cell. 2010, 22:2926. RS40 binds to HYL1 and co-localizes to the nuclear dicing body. Along with RS41, it appears to be involved in pri-miRNA processing and miRNA biogenesis (DOI:10.1093/nar/gkv751).;computational_description=arginine/serine-rich splicing factor 35;locus=2131864;locus_type=protein_coding
