Chr4	Araport11	gene	15390519	15394626	.	-	.	ID=AT4G31820;Name=AT4G31820;Note=Phototropic-responsive NPH3 family protein;curator_summary=A member of the NPY family genes (NPY1/AT4G31820, NPY2/AT2G14820, NPY3/AT5G67440, NPY4/AT2G23050, NPY5/AT4G37590).  Encodes a protein with similarity to NHP3. Contains BTB/POZ domain. Promoter region has  canonical auxin response element binding site and Wus binding site. Co-localizes to the late endosome with PID. Regulates cotyledon development through control of PIN1 polarity in concert with PID. Also involved in sepal and gynoecia development.;computational_description=Phototropic-responsive NPH3 family protein;locus=2116752;locus_type=protein_coding
